Package: DONA
Type: Package
Title: Ligand-Receptor Interaction Pipeline
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("LodanElmugamer", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "lodanelmugamer@gmail.com")
Description: Provides a reusable workflow for running and comparing ligand-receptor
    interaction analyses from annotated Seurat objects. The included pipeline supports
    CellChat, CellPhoneDB, LIANA and SingleCellSignalR, per-condition ranking,
    plotting, expression checks and cross-tool consensus analysis.
